You finally showed up. Do you know what time it is?

198
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:41,000
I came for you, kid. Step outside for a second.

199
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:51,000
What's this about? Are you having some sort of a problem here?

200
00:11:51,000 --> 00:11:53,000
