212
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:45,000
Well, now that you mention it, he did ask about Stein's condition after the battle on Lost Island.

213
00:12:46,000 --> 00:12:52,000
Oh? That is unexpected. Why would a child like Krona be concerned about Professor Stein?

214
00:12:53,000 --> 00:12:55,000
I don't get it. He seemed really shaken up.

215
00:12:55,000 --> 00:12:57,000
How unfortunate.

216
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:01,000
