249
00:15:07,000 --> 00:15:09,000
That's why his soul force attack didn't work.

250
00:15:09,000 --> 00:15:11,000
His wavelength is paralyzed by doubt.

251
00:15:12,000 --> 00:15:13,000
Is that even possible?

252
00:15:13,000 --> 00:15:14,000
I've seen it happen before.

253
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:17,000
It doesn't take much to change his soul wavelength.

254
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:19,000
Doubting yourself will do it every time.

255
00:15:19,000 --> 00:15:21,000
I've known Blackstar for a long time.

256
00:15:22,000 --> 00:15:23,000
Since he was an infant.

257
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:26,000
He has great talent.

258
00:15:27,000 --> 00:15:28,000
His soul is strong.

259
00:15:29,000 --> 00:15:30,000
He's willing to work hard.

260
00:15:31,000 --> 00:15:34,000
Against a single opponent or many, it doesn't matter.

261
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:36,000
He'll beat them all, one by one.

262
00:15:37,000 --> 00:15:38,000
That's what he does.

263
00:15:39,000 --> 00:15:40,000
That's who he is.

